#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:17
#: ac5804d15b164baf8bf24856ec9bc34d
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:19
#: 2bec8ffffc8e45ec9e33d9f7093b7ee6
msgid ""
"DroneCAN is a lightweight protocol designed for reliable communication in "
"aerospace and robotic applications via CAN bus. The DroneCAN network is a "
"decentralized peer network, where each peer (node) has a unique numeric "
"identifier - node ID and that is only one parameter needs to be set for "
"basic setup."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN 是一种轻量级协议，专为通过 CAN 总线在航空航天和机器人应用中实现可靠通信而设计。DroneCAN "
"网络是一个去中心化的对等网络，每个对等体（节点）都有一个唯一的数字标识符——节点 ID，这是基本设置中唯一需要配置的参数。"

