#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:95
#: 864b30af3358445fb6d8b4dfabb651d8
msgid ""
"If there is a DroneCAN GPS device, it has to be enabled in ``GPS`` subgroup "
"of parameters. The ``TYPE`` parameter should be set to 9 for corresponding "
