#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:106
#: f9276032e9454e2d9da6784a3acfc255
msgid ""
"DroneCAN LEDs are enabled by setting bit 5 in the "
":ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` bitmask. The "
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_NTF_RT<CAN_D1_UC_NTF_RT>` sets the rate that notification "
"messages are transmitted in DroneCAN."
