"通过在 :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` 位掩码中设置第 5 位来启用 DroneCAN "
"LED。:ref:`CAN_D1_UC_NTF_RT<CAN_D1_UC_NTF_RT>` 设置通过 DroneCAN 发送通知消息的速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:109
#: f5849e70eefb49708ae7a80cf4646f3c
msgid "DroneCAN Rangefinder configuration"
msgstr "DroneCAN 测距仪配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:111
#: 6201637afe2e4ea0b5f95a7db68578f9
msgid ""
"Set ``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` = 24 to enable DroneCAN rangefinder type. Rangefinder "
"data received over DroneCAN will only be used if the received sensor_id "
"matches the parameter ``RNGFNDx_ADDR``. For AP_Periph firmware based adaptor"
" nodes, this value is 0, so ``RNGFNDx_ADDR`` must be set to 0. Other "
"DroneCAN rangefinders may differ. See also :ref:`DroneCAN Adaptor "
"Node<common-uavcan-adapter-node>` instructions."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` = 24 以启用 DroneCAN 测距仪类型。通过 DroneCAN 接收的测距仪数据仅在接收到的 "
"sensor_id 与参数 ``RNGFNDx_ADDR`` 匹配时才会使用。对于基于 AP_Periph 固件的适配器节点，此值为 0，因此 "
"``RNGFNDx_ADDR`` 必须设为 0。其他 DroneCAN 测距仪可能不同。另见 :ref:`DroneCAN Adaptor "
"Node<common-uavcan-adapter-node>` 说明。"

