#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:136
#: 5cf7fde97c5846d9ba0766b6c3c0a06f
msgid "DroneCAN Node ID Conflicts"
msgstr "DroneCAN 节点 ID 冲突"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:138
#: 261e64ed0a7b450795d5503ae2b9b6a9
msgid ""
"When a device is attached and recognized, it's node ID and hardware ID are "
"entered into a database which is stored between power cycles. If multiple "
"devices with the same node ID and different hardware IDs are used (swapping "
"smart batteries, for example, with the same node ID), a conflict will arise "
"in the database. This will require the use of the "
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>` parameter to allow the database to"
" be reset on the next boot, or conflicts in the database to be ignored."
msgstr ""
"当设备连接并被识别后，其节点 ID 和硬件 ID 将录入数据库，并在断电后保留。如果使用多个具有相同节点 ID 但不同硬件 ID "
"的设备（例如交换具有相同节点 ID 的智能电池），数据库中将产生冲突。这需要使用 "
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>` 参数，允许在下次启动时重置数据库，或忽略数据库中的冲突。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:143
#: b76149e860a14934af70a009abe570ba
msgid "CAN FD (Flexible Data rate)"
msgstr "CAN FD（灵活数据率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:145
#: c09ea747e0874d749fd6a6b716d0d8e0
msgid ""
"If the DroneCAN port is attached to CAN FD peripherials, setting "
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>` bit 2 (+ value 4) will enable this"
" mode."
msgstr ""
"如果 DroneCAN 端口连接的是 CAN FD 外设，设置 :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>` 第 "
"2 位（加值 4）将启用此模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:147
#: 99983066cc174f78a86f63af77ca2896
msgid ""
"CAN FD requires a larger memory pool allocation than normal. Default is 24KB"
" instead of the normal 12KB."
msgstr "CAN FD 比普通模式需要更大的内存池分配。默认为 24KB，而普通模式为 12KB。"

