#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:172
#: 0fead9ed00a243dfb46812f945ad3fbd
msgid ""
"ArduPilot and DroneCAN provide a means to directly communicate with DroneCAN"
" devices on the CAN BUS attached to the autopilot: SLCAN. Enabling SLCAN and"
" communicating with the DroneCAN devices is dependent on the autopilot's "
"processor. F7/H7 processors use one method and F4, a different method."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 和 DroneCAN 提供了一种直接与连接到飞控 CAN 总线上的 DroneCAN 设备通信的方式：SLCAN。启用 SLCAN "
"并与 DroneCAN 设备通信取决于飞控的处理器。F7/H7 处理器使用一种方法，F4 使用另一种方法。"

